\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Lord God, Oh let your glory
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Bless all our marriages
\par To let all the flesh and soul
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Grow in spiritual realm
\par Both the husband and the wife
\par Will look forward in hope and
\par To your good direction
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. It is through the will of God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The marriage is started
\par Whenever marriage breaks down
\par The couple miss the way
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It is the will of God that
\par Couples are united
\par And live in true and love
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Oh Lord God, let divine love
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And faithfulness remain
\par Within all married couples
\par To be renewed each day
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let them produce, multiply
\par And to live with one accord
\par To stay in one spirit
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Let Thy word dwell within them
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To rule over their home
\par Let them become Thy household
\par Kindly grant them Thy peace
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Oh let all their thoughts and words
\par And works be manifested
\par That they are Thine household
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. Let them always be at peace
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 As Thou so desireth
\par Grant them Thy divine Talents
\par Throughout their lives on earth
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Whatever yokes they carry
\par Let them in joy to carry
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj To gain eternal rest. \tab 
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

